      "writtenOn": "2026-02-09T07:01:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "getGlobalVisibleRect() primarily accounts for RenderNode-based property transformations and parent clipping. It does not inherently factor in legacy AnimationMatrix (View Animation). I have deliberately chosen not to manually handle AnimationMatrix in this patch, as the complexity and risk of coordinate double-mapping outweigh the marginal benefit, given that most modern transitions have migrated to property animations.\"",
